          "description": "Bring happy hour home with a traditional Mai Tai recipe. In this video, you’ll learn how to make the original Mai Tai using fresh lime juice and light and dark rums—no pre-made mixes. Mixing a Mai Tai easy and refreshing, like a day at the beach! Think of it as a rum-based take on the classic margarita—both call for Triple Sec and lime juice—but then two kinds of rum take the Mai Tai in a distinctly tropical direction. You’ll see how to garnish this Tahitian treasure and discover the perfect cocktail glass for serving your Mai Tais. You’ll also uncover the amazing story behind this delicious tropical cocktail—It’s “mai tai roa e!”",
